            <p><strong>Nama:</strong> <span id="acc-name">Researcher</span></p>
            <p><strong>Email:</strong> <span id="acc-email">scholar@polya-apologetika.org</span></p>
            <p><strong>Role:</strong> Apologist / Debater</p>
