            <h4>💳 Status Lisensi & Kuota</h4>
            <p><strong>Tier:</strong> <span id="acc-tier-display">FREE</span></p>
            <p><strong>Analisis Terpakai:</strong> <span id="acc-used-count">0</span> / 5</p>
            <div style="margin-top: 1rem;">
              <button class="btn-primary" style="width: auto; background: var(--gold); color: #040914;" onclick="openCheckoutModal()">
                Upgrade ke Polya Premium (Rp99.000)
